      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Honestly with these proposed customizations, I'd eliminate the 'top left clickable buttons' (I have them memorized), move the 'top right Mute / face mirror / third person' to the bottom left, scale it up, and move the face mirror to the bottom center (so the webcam face tracking doesn't show me glancing to the side all the time to see my face)\n\nI hope there will be snapping for the centerlines!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
